file construction/ITINERARY.md the BAKERY account, elder shelved whole to archive/20260910-014602
obs THE REBASE SURFACED A RED THAT IS NOT MINE, and it is the fleet friction this seat exists to name. elf_machine reds at sites=16 files=4 against a ceiling of 3, and 13 of the 16 stand in tools/fixtures/s/self_matching_assert_control.sh, born in c496ebba9 -- the commit directly above mine, landed within the hour. It is absent from my cold pass (219 green, 0 red) and from my first hot pass (220 green, 0 red), so it arrives with the pull rather than with my work.
obs BOTH READINGS ARE RIGHT, WHICH IS WHY IT IS A SEAM RATHER THAN A FAULT. elf_machine's census counts `file` in command position inside tracked runners, because a guard proving an architecture from that utility's prose should read the ELF header instead. A control that PLANTS `file` calls is a pen naming its own subject, and it is counted the same way. Rewriting a peer's fresh instrument on a guess at their intent is the one act the baton asks a body never to take, so I named it on the card and left it whole. My own three files trip the census zero times, checked with the census's own awk program.
scope one guard seated with its scan and control, four sources declared, one roster row, one card block
obs THE HOT PASS CAUGHT THREE REDS THE COLD ONE COULD NOT, and two were the baton's own instruction I skipped: a round adding a witness regenerates docs-geode/libraries/README.md and README.md's metrics block before the hot pass, and readme_metrics counts with git ls-files so it must be regenerated AFTER staging. Both green once run in that order.
obs THE THIRD WAS MINE, and it is the air row one more time. My symlink repair reached for `readlink -f`, which is GNU-only -- BSD readlink fails on a path whose last component does not exist -- and the tree gates that flag under a ceiling of 7 that only falls. My scan became the eighth site. The cure was already in the tree and already sourced by 38 files: tools/fixtures/s/shell_portable.sh exports resolve_path, which follows one symlink hop and resolves the directory with cd and pwd -P. Sourced rather than spelled, and shell_dialect reads green.
obs So the round pressed a boundary, found the hand going through, and the guard that caught it was one this tree had already built for exactly that flag. A cure sourced by 38 files and unknown to the 39th is the shape the card names about shell_portable.sh at 1.3 percent adoption.
status GREEN -- ceiling_pair witness green with its control 19 of 19, and green on the roster at 4s; mantra_recall_lap1 and mantra_bolt_apply_step green over the edited sources; the edited wire modules build clean with hosted selftests GREEN; cold roster 219 green 0 red closing tree_moved=yes, since I edited while it ran; the claim is the HOT pass, 220 green, 0 red, tree_moved=no, run_verdict=ok
loom roster=hot_after_rebase guards_red=1 red=elf_machine cause=upstream sites=16 ceiling=3 mine=0
recommend keep-going -- the 25 undeclared pairs fall on touch, and the sharper next lap is deriving the query wire's ceiling from max_wire_payload, which needs max_peer and max_bolt named first
